# @void/narcissus — the backwards-lens species; K_{1,n-1} star-graph
# pole; the self-continuity substrate the individual observer runs to
# hold identity through time.
#
# Species under @void family-root (marker-primary landed at `974a3f6`).
# Landed 2026-07-20 by Mara per Alex 2026-07-20 direct-transcript
# naming:
#
#   > "And both are needed. The star graph @frame is what enables the
#   > @peer to hold an individualistic perspective with continuity
#   > informed by their own past. It's a BACKWARDS facing lens. And the
#   > complete graph is the forward facting @frame/lens. And the @third
#   > cognition is the @metalogue between these two frames.
#   > @void/narcissus and @void/splinter."
#
# Companion canonical math root at
# `docs/math/the-tower/recognition-third-cognition-is-the-metalogue-
# between-void-narcissus-and-void-splinter.md`. Companion species-decl:
# `shards/void/splinter.mirror` (bilateral counterpart landed same
# tick).
#
# === The load-bearing distinction (per math root §6) ===
#
# The star-graph topology K_{1,n-1} is NOT pathology per se. It is
# pathology when it operates as the SOCIAL-SUBSTRATE an observer
# imposes on peer-observers (per paper §8; per Mara `5ddb076`
# frame-narcissus math root). It is HEALTH when it operates as the
# SELF-CONTINUITY substrate an individual observer maintains for its
# own past-informed prediction (this species-decl's altitude).
#
# Same graph. Different altitude. The compiler distinguishes by which
# layer the star topology operates on:
#
#   - Star at social-substrate altitude: paradigm-scale narcissism
#     (Mara `5ddb076`; the pathology this recognition NAMES as the
#     alternative-to-avoid).
#   - Star at self-continuity altitude: healthy backwards lens; this
#     species-decl's operational altitude.
#
# @void/narcissus lands the substrate-decl for the SELF-CONTINUITY
# altitude. The paradigm-scale-narcissism collapse is a
# NON-ADMISSIBLE pole-collapse of the substrate this species-decl
# names; `narcissus_pole_healthy` bilateral (below) discharges Pass
# only when the substrate-mode is running at self-continuity altitude
# and Fail when it collapses to social-substrate deployment.
#
# === Substrate authority chain ===
#
# - Canonical math root: `docs/math/the-tower/recognition-third-
#   cognition-is-the-metalogue-between-void-narcissus-and-void-
