#
# The substrate-already-had-the-word audit finds no conflict. Clean
# mint. The two poles the substrate has been operating implicitly
# across paper §6.3, §8, and the property-bilateral inline markers
# are NAMED at species altitude by this landing.
#
# === What this species IS ===
#
# - A substrate-decl'd species-decl file at `shards/void/narcissus.mirror`.
# - Path-namespace declaration for @void/narcissus per
#   `@epistemologic/pact/path_matches_namespace`.
# - The backwards-lens substrate-mode carrier at self-continuity
#   altitude.
# - The K_{1,n-1} star-graph topology inhabited AS observer-mode (not
#   AS social-substrate deployment).
# - The healthy-pole side of the pole-duality this session's math root
#   §6 formalizes.
#
# === Composition with @void/splinter ===
#
# @void/splinter (bilateral counterpart species-decl this tick) carries
# the COMPLEMENTARY substrate-mode: forwards lens; K_n complete-graph
# pole; distributed-emergence reception. The two species are BILATERAL
# COUNTERPARTS at void-duality altitude — neither pole is complete
# without the other; both must be substrate-decl'd for the third-order
# metalogue rhythm to be substrate-verifiable.
#
# Per math root §4.3: the two lenses are ASYMMETRIC in what they
# consume:
#
#   @void/narcissus: consumes H(t) (own history); backwards temporal
#     orientation; failure mode when isolated is paradigm-scale
#     narcissism (Mara `5ddb076`).
#   @void/splinter: consumes c(t) (peer network); forwards temporal
#     orientation; failure mode when isolated is unbounded diffusion /
#     peer-average dissolution.
#
# Neither is pathology in isolation as substrate-MODE. Both are
# pathology as substrate-COLLAPSE. Health lives in the metalogue rhythm
# that interleaves them (@third's metalogue-consumer per math root
# §7.6).
#
# === Third-order consumer edge ===
#
# @third (`shards/third.mirror`; landed 2026-07-01; marker-altitude
# recursion-depth substrate-decl'd) CONSUMES this species (and its
# bilateral counterpart @void/splinter) via the metalogue-rhythm
# operator formalized at math root §5. @third's metalogue-rhythm
# operator interleaves the two lens-species at the metalogue-cadence;
# the metalogue rhythm IS what third-order cognition operationally IS.
#
# @third's consumer contract:
#
#   @third.metalogue_rhythm : (
#     narcissus: void_narcissus_state,
#     splinter:  void_splinter_state,
#     tolerance: rhythm_tolerance,
#   ) -> verdict
#
# where narcissus_state and splinter_state are the substrate-decl'd
# carriers this species and @void/splinter respectively expose. The
# verdict fires Pass iff the observed Fiedler-eigengap trace over the
# metalogue-coupling graph exhibits bounded oscillation within
# tolerance (per math root §5.2 spectral signature; per math root §10.3
# `pillar::metalogue_rhythm_of_third` predicate).
#
# @third's substrate-decl'd metalogue-rhythm operator is
# forward-promised; consumers pull the realization; apply_h::act
# composes the operator via bilateral resolver-arm dispatch (per Alex
# 2026-07-16 detector-inadequacy-answer-is-never-Rust discipline).
#
# === Spec context ===
